            <h1 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-4">How to Make a Gun Inventory List (Step-by-Step)</h1>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg mb-6">A clear system for cataloging firearms, serial numbers, photos, values, accessories, and ammo — without relying on memory or a messy spreadsheet forever.</p>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400">
